text.paragraph:
Regularly evaluate patients particularly when initiating and titrating tramadol hydrochloride extended-release tablets and when tramadol hydrochloride extended-release tablets are given concomitantly with other drugs that depress respiration [see Warnings and Precautions (5), 
                           Drug Interactions (7)
                           ]. Alternatively, consider the use of non-opioid analgesics in these patients.
